    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "followup_message",
      "label": "Client follow-up message",
      "default": "Perfect. Also, heads up: the new collection is coming together for early next month. Can we grab 30 minutes this week to walk through the launch plan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Portal mockup"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
